Z||000034||BOILERMAKER||11-19-1999||07:45 AM||||Just got my cam yesterday and oil pump.  Boy am I getting more and more excited by the day.  I must admit that I got a little enthusiastic last night and decided to put it (the cam) in.  Early next week I am expecting to pick up my heads and crank.<P>Next step, to get the flywheel balanced (well of course pay for the heads and crank -- ouch!) and to somehow get summit to ship my fuel pressure regulator.  For some reason the ACCEL part # is always on backorder.<p>[This message has been edited by BOILERMAKER (edited 11-19-1999).]||||reg||1
